insurance plan with ICICI Lombard Group Health Top-up Plan. To get high sum insured up to ₹ 50 Lakh with Premium Starting at ₹ 7 per day. Watch this video to know on, how to avail  group health top up insurance, premium amount, sum assured, family member addition and more with ICICI Bank Internet Banking.\n\nSteps to avail Group Health Top Up Plan through ICICI Bank Internet Banking:\n- Login to internet banking and select “General Insurance”.\n- Select “Health Top Up” and click on “Insure Now”.\n- Select the Sum Insured.\n- Fill in the personal details of the family members you would like to insure.\n- Select a preferred deductible value among 3 Lakhs, 4 Lakhs and 5 Lakhs.\n- Fill in the nominee details and proceed to payment.\n- Select payment mode before tapping on “Proceed”.\n- Congratulations! You have booked your Group Health Top Up Policy.\n\nTo know more about ICICI Bank Health Top Up Cover:\nhttps://www.icicibank.com/Personal-Banking/insurance/health-insurance/health-booster.page\n\nSubscribe to the ICICI Bank YouTube Channel and remember to press the bell icon to get notifications on our latest products and services offerings. \nhttps://www.youtube.com/user/icicibank/videos?sub_confirmation=1\n\nThere is more than one way to connect with us, so be sure to check our ICICI Bank at:\nWebsite: https://www.icicibank.com\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/icicibank\nLinkedIn: https://in.linkedin.com/company/icici-bank\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/icicibank\n\n\n\n\n\"\nYou can support your existing health insurance plan with ICICI Lombard Group Health Top-up Plan. Get benefits of high sum insured plan up to Rs 50 lakh. To access Group Health Top-up Insurance log in to Internet Banking.\n\n#healthinsurance #healthinsuranceplan", "channel_id": "UCDsxd7FVqC4n9AiggDXHUqQ", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDsxd7FVqC4n9AiggDXHUqQ", "duration": 66, "view_count": 888, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IWnPG2JaKOo", "categ